			"notes": "Features\n- Translated to italian, chinese & german\n- Added new gauge specific ponder APIs\n- gauges can read the first page of clipboards\n\nFixes\n- NullPointerException crash with mods using null containers. aka Curvy pipes\n- Factory Gauges only binds items to the network that are an instance of LogisticallyLinkedBlockItem\n- Display Boards don't show item count and name\n- Powered display links update when connected to extra gauges"
